Package: helm
Architecture: amd64
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
Description: package manager for Kubernetes
 Helm installs, upgrades and removes applications on a Kubernetes cluster
 as versioned charts: templated bundles of manifests with their default
 values, which a release tracks through upgrades and rollbacks.
 .
 This package repacks the upstream release binary, a static Go build: no
 Ubuntu or Debian archive carries helm, and the vendor apt repository on
 baltocdn.com serves a certificate chain apt cannot verify. debian/rules
 downloads the release named in debian/changelog from get.helm.sh and
 checks it against the sha256 recorded in debian/upstream-sha256.
